\par \pard\plain \s67\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\contextualspace\ltrpar{\listtext\pard\plain  \u61623\'3f\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360{\loch\b\loch
Tag 1, the door tag:}{\loch
 top layer of the second pallet from the doors, kerb side, about 20 cm in from the wall, inside a carton and not taped to the outside. This is the warmest spot in the box. It is there on purpose.}
\par \pard\plain \s67\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\contextualspace\ltrpar{\listtext\pard\plain  \u61623\'3f\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360{\loch\b\loch
Tag 2, the middle tag:}{\loch
 centre of the load, middle pallet, half height, roughly 1.1 m up. In a 20' this tag is left out.}
\par \pard\plain \s67\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\contextualspace\ltrpar{\listtext\pard\plain  \u61623\'3f\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360{\loch\b\loch
Tag 3, the nose tag:}{\loch
 bottom layer of the pallet nearest the unit, about 30 cm off the floor. Coldest spot. It is the freeze-damage detector and the reason bananas hate us occasionally.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af11\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe1033{\loch
To activate a tag, hold the button for 4 seconds until the green LED blinks twice. Then wait and watch the KC-Hub 200 screen: the tag must show online within 90 seconds, otherwise it goes in the red bin and you take another. Do not use any tag whose battery is under 2.85 V on the Tidewalk tag screen (the Voltrac cells drop off a cliff, they do not fade). Logging interval is 5 minutes by default, 10 minutes for frozen and 2 minutes for pharma loads. Separate from the tags: the hand probe goes into the first, a middle and the last pallet loaded, and those three numbers go on the form.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\rtlch\af11\afs26\ab \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\keep\widctlpar\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf18\f6\fs26\b\dbch\af10{\loch
4. Doors, docks, time}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af11\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe1033{\loch
